<body>
<div type="letter">
<pb facs="1078790" n="1"/>
  <opener><salute rend="center">Viro Clarissimo atque Incomparabili
      <lb/>Johanni <rs key="pers_DE-588-118509969" type="person">Bernoulli</rs>
      <lb/><abbr>S. P. D.</abbr>
      <lb/>Petrus Antonius <rs key="pers_DE-588-102552517" type="person">Michelotti</rs></salute></opener>
  <p>Occasione discessus ab hac inclita Civitate Eruditissi<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>mi <rs key="pers_DE-588-1141836866" type="person">Lesly</rs>  (qui honorifice Philosophi<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> et <choice><abbr>Med.<hi rend="sup">n<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></hi></abbr><expan>Medicin<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></expan></choice>
      <lb/>Lauream Patavii nuper suscepit) mihi tempe<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>rare non possum quin Tibi Vir Celeberrime
      <lb/>et Doctissimo Agnato tuo <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Nicolao</rs> salutem plurimam
      <lb/>mittam. Annotationes <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Agnati</rs> tui nunquam
      <lb/>satis laudandi excerptas ex Diarii nostri Tomo vigesimo
      <lb/>ad Vos pervenisse non ambigo. Inpr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>sentiarum vos
      <lb/>admonitos volo quod D. Comes <rs key="pers_DE-588-119543885" type="person">Riccatus</rs> responsionem
      <lb/>parat ad vestras <rs key="biblio_QETMIRCN" type="biblio">Annotationes</rs> in suum <rs key="biblio_QETMIRCN" type="biblio">schediasma</rs>;
      <lb/>qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> quidem <rs key="biblio_DHVYFVAZ" type="biblio">responsio</rs> futuro mense Augusti in Diarii
      <lb/>Tomo XXI in publicum prodibit: Statim ac eam videro
      <lb/>ad vos transmittam. Ceterum ipse <rs key="pers_DE-588-119543885" type="person">Riccatus</rs> plurima
      <lb/>iactat adversus vestras Annotationes. Necessum itaque erit
      <lb/>ut <choice><abbr>Clariss.<hi rend="sup">us</hi></abbr><expan>Clarissimus</expan></choice> <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Agnatus</rs> tuus in secunda responsione
      <lb/>conetur talia proferre ut vix sit locus ulteriori contro<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>versi ; qua de re ego nullam habeo dubitationem. Post
      <lb/>quadrimestre circiter fiet aliqua mutatio in <rs type="organisation">Magistra<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tu</rs> <choice><abbr>Illustr.</abbr><expan>Illustrissimorum</expan></choice> et <choice><abbr>Excell.</abbr><expan>Excellentissimorum</expan></choice> <rs key="pers_DE-588-1089924410 pers_DE-588-1111043582 pers_DE-588-1178371670" type="person">Moderatorum</rs> <rs type="organisation">Archilycei Patavini</rs>: eo
      <lb/>tempore succedet <choice><abbr>Nobiliss.<hi rend="sup">us</hi></abbr><expan>Nobilissimus</expan></choice> <choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>ques ac <choice><abbr>D.</abbr><expan>Divi</expan></choice> Marci <choice><abbr>Procu.<hi rend="sup">r</hi></abbr><expan>Procurator</expan></choice> <rs key="pers_DE-588-1253768439" type="person">Vene<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>rius</rs> M<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>cenas meus semper colendus; quare ipsi proponam
<pb facs="1078791" n="2"/>
      <lb/>pro celebri Mathematico Agnatum tuum <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Nicolaum</rs>, et
      <lb/>efficiam pro meis viribus ut ipsum vocare ad edocendas
      <lb/>mathematicas disciplinas non dedignetur: mathematum
      <lb/>enim <rs type="organisation">cathedra</rs> adhuc vacat in <rs type="organisation">Archilyceo patavino</rs>
      <lb/>omnesque dolent quod Tu Vir Amicissime eandem
      <lb/>recusaveris.</p>
  <p>Responsiones ad mea problemata expecto magna cum
      <lb/>voluptate, quibus, si mihi permittes, utar in mea
      <lb/>dissertatione, cui titulus erit <rs key="biblio_M3G2JA79" type="biblio"><hi rend="u"><choice><sic>Hypoth<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>sium</sic><corr>Hypothaesium</corr></choice> secretio<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>nis animalis Examen Medico-Mechanicum</hi></rs>.</p>
  <p>Rogo ut me admoneas si aliquid novi apud vos, aut
      <lb/><rs key="place_GEO-2988507" type="place">Parisiis</rs> in publicum proditurum sit de rebus mathe<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>maticis, physicis, anatomicis, et medicis. Tractatum
      <lb/>calculi differentialis et integralis si publici iuris faceret
      <lb/><choice><abbr>Clariss.<hi rend="sup">us</hi></abbr><expan>Clarissimus</expan></choice> <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Agnatus</rs> Tuus (namque potest) sibi viam ape<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>riret ad acquirendam Mathematum <rs type="organisation">cathedram</rs> <rs key="place_GEO-3171728" type="place">Patavi<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>nam</rs>.</p> <closer><salute>Vale Vir Illustrissime, meque amare perge.</salute>
      <lb/><dateline>Dabam <rs key="place_GEO-3164603" type="place">Venetiis</rs> <date when="1715-07-04">Quarto Nonas Iulias 1715</date>.<note type="editorial" resp="SG">Die Datierung «Quarto Nonas Iulias» entspricht dem 4. Juli 1715. Die Nonen fallen im Juli auf den 7. Tag; bei der Rückwärtszählung wird dieser Tag mitgezählt.</note></dateline></closer>
<pb facs="1078792" n="3" type="empty"/>
<pb facs="1078793" n="4" type="empty"/>
</div></body></text></TEI>
